			<Comment>♂
・続けてsage1_end_01d
※寒いのでウロウロしながら</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</CommentCell>
